<title>USA: NCAA-Weekend men's college basketball results.</title>
<headline>NCAA-Weekend men's college basketball results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekend regional final results in the 1997 NCAA men's college basketball tournament (prefix number denotes regional seeding):</p>
<p>Saturday</p>
<p>Midwest Region (at San Antonio, Texas)</p>
<p> 1-Minnesota	    80    2-UCLA		72</p>
<p>West Region (at San Jose, California)</p>
<p> 1-Kentucky	     72    2-Utah		59</p>
<p>Sunday</p>
<p>East Region (at Syracuse, New York)</p>
<p> 1-North Carolina     97    6-Louisville	74</p>
<p>Southeast Region (at Birmingham, Alabama)</p>
<p> 4-Arizona		96    10-Providence     92 (OT)</p>
<p>Note: Minnesota, Kentucky, North Carolina and Arizona advance to Final Four at Indianapolis</p>
</text>
